 "hide_family": {
  "law": "The reference's family is four component actions, in this menu order: Hide Selected (H), Hide Unselected (Shift+H), Hide Invert (Ctrl+H), Unhide (U; Shift+U also unhides all). Hide Selected hides the selected polygons and they leave the selection; Hide Unselected keeps the selection; Hide Invert flips every polygon's hidden flag in polygon mode; Unhide clears all hidden flags regardless of selection. Each is one undo step restoring the selection too, except that Hide Invert's undo restores NOTHING hidden (the pre-invert hidden set is lost) -- a known reference defect we do not reproduce.",
